 We can set the item ids on this hook MODULE_NAME_paypal_plus_set_item_ids and get that ids with the function get_paypal_plus_item_ids() insides of the following hooks hook_paypal_plus_success_message()

hook_paypal_plus_cancel_message()

hook_paypal_plus_success_redirect()

hook_paypal_plus_failure_redirect() for the extra functionality and processing with that items ids according to your requirement.

 Features 

 Block form Implementations 
 Webform (if wanting to send webform submissions to a enabled list) 
 Paypal Plus service implementation 

